      "id": 22,
      "question": "A rapid finger-prick blood test to help diagnosis deep vein thrombosis is developed. Comparing the test to current standard techniques a study is done on 1,000 patients:\n\n\n\tDVT present\tDVT absent\nNew test positive\t200\t100\nNew test negative\t20\t680\n\nWhat is the specificity of the new test?",
