      "id": 183,
      "question": "A small study is carried out to investigate the effects of a new nicotine replacement therapy (NRT) on the frequency of cigarette smoking cravings. Patients cravings were recorded 1 week before and 1 week after the introduction of the new NRT agent. A 5-point severity score was used to record cravings.\n\nWhat statistical test is the best to compare the before and after intervention results in this study?",
