      "id": 283,
      "question": "A 35-year-old woman has recently been diagnosed with breast and ovarian cancer. Her mother and sister were also diagnosed with breast and ovarian cancer before the age of 40. She has no other medical history.\n\nOn examination, there was a left breast lump and palpable axillary lymph nodes.\n\nFrom the options listed, what is the best investigation to confirm the underlying genetic diagnosis?",
