      "question": "An 18-year-old man is referred to the acute medical team with nausea and vomiting. He is a type 1 diabetic and has recently been unwell. Blood tests confirm diabetic ketoacidosis, and he is started on an insulin infusion.\n\nWhat type of receptor does this treatment bind to?",
