      "question": "A 14-year-old boy presents to the paediatric oncology clinic with a rapidly enlarging jaw mass and cervical lymphadenopathy. He has no significant past medical history. A biopsy confirms a high-grade B-cell lymphoma, and cytogenetic analysis reveals a t(8;14) translocation. Which oncogene is most commonly implicated in this malignancy?",
