      "question": "A patient is involved in a research trial looking into lysosomal storage disorders. The trial is investigating the golgi apparatus and it's role in the trafficking of proteins to lysosomes. Researchers hope to adapt the molecules bound to proteins in an attempt to manage the disorder.\n\nWhat molecule is responsible for binding and trafficking?",
