      "question": "A 23-year-old healthcare worker undergoes an interferon-gamma release assay (IGRA) as part of an occupational health assessment. He migrated to the UK from Bangladesh aged six and is unsure of his vaccination history. He denies ever having been symptomatic with tuberculosis infection in the past.\n\nWhich of the following most accurately describes the normal physiological role of the cytokine underpinning this diagnostic test?",
