      "question": "A randomised controlled trial evaluates a new antihypertensive medication compared to placebo in 1000 patients with hypertension. After 5 years, 40 patients in the treatment group (n=500) and 80 patients in the placebo group (n=500) developed a myocardial infarction.\n\nWhat is the number needed to treat (NNT) to prevent one myocardial infarction?",
