      "id": 471,
      "question": "A study is being conducted, looking at the use of ibuprofen for rotator cuff injuries and the effectiveness of pain relief. A total of 350 people with recent rotator cuff injuries are recruited and assigned to either the ibuprofen group or placebo group. Several hours post-administration of either ibuprofen or placebo, they are asked about pain relief. The results are summarised as follows:\n\n\n\tTotal number of patients\tReported significant pain relief\nIbuprofen\t200\t120\nPlacebo\t150\t30\n\nWhat is the relative risk of pain relief with ibuprofen, relative to placebo?",
