      "question": "A 68-year-old female presents with a 5-month history of itching near her buttocks.\n\nOn examination, there is an excoriated depigmented patch measuring 3x4cm, located around 2cm lateral to the anus on the right side.\n\nWhat is the most likely diagnosis?",
