      "id": 216,
      "question": "A 33-year-old woman presents to her general practitioner with excessive hair growth on her face. She has a past medical history of obesity and her body mass index is 35 kg/m².\n\nOn examination, she has thick dark hair on her face.\n\nAfter trialling weight loss, what pharmacological treatment is most appropriate?",
