      "question": "A 55-year-old patient with well-managed diabetes expresses concern about his diet, particularly regarding his frequent consumption of white bread. He asks how eating foods with a high glycaemic index, such as white bread, might influence his blood glucose control.\n\nWhat effect do such foods typically have on blood glucose levels?",
