      "question": "A 32-year-old woman is referred to the gastroenterology clinic with a 6-month history of intermittent diarrhoea, bloating and unexplained weight loss. She has a past medical history of type 1 diabetes mellitus. Her blood tests show iron deficiency anaemia. Upper GI endoscopy with duodenal biopsy confirms villous atrophy. Which genetic marker is most strongly associated with her condition?",
