      "question": "A 34-year-old gentleman presented with severe abdominal pain and bloody diarrhoea after returning from a business trip to Thailand. He is normally fit and takes not medications.\n\nYour lab calls to say that amoebic trophozoites have been identified in his stool.\n\nWhich of the following combinations of medications would be the most appropriate?",
