      "question": "A 19-year-old student attends the general medical clinic. She has returned from Mozambique recently and have noticed new urinary symptoms. Of note, they developed a rash while in Mozambique after they went swimming. The rash gradually resolved but since returning they have had blood in their urine and are micturating with greater frequency.\n\nWhat is the most appropriate treatment?",
