      "id": 292,
      "question": "A 17-year-old girl presents to the emergency department complaining of a widespread erythematous rash. She has recently been commenced on amoxicillin for an upper respiratory tract infection by her general practitioner. Which of the following is the most appropriate test to provide a diagnosis?",
