      "question": "A 14-year-old girl is admitted to the emergency department with reduced consciousness and a rash. She had been unwell over the last 3 days. She lives with her mother and father.\n\nA lumbar puncture is performed with initial results showing a high white blood cell count. Gram staining reveals gram-negative diplococci.\n\nWhat is the recommendation for the parents of the patient?",
