      "id": 486,
      "question": "A 25-year-old man has been admitted to hospital with several injuries after he was mugged on his way home from the pub last night. During the altercation, he was bitten by his attacker and has been left with deep bite marks on his hand, which looks red and swollen. You prescribe tetanus and hepatitis B prophylaxis.\n\nWhich antibiotic will you prescribe for him?",
