      "question": "A 72-year-old man is admitted to the urology ward with newly diagnosed metastatic prostate cancer. He is started on a GnRH agonist for androgen deprivation therapy. To prevent complications from initial hormonal changes, an additional medication is prescribed. Which of the following best explains the primary mechanism of action of this adjunctive drug?",
