      "explanation": "Confusion, gait ataxia, nystagmus + ophthalmoplegia are features of Wernicke's encephalopathy\n\nA useful mnemonic to remember the features of Wernicke's encephalopathy is\n\nCAN OPEN\n\nC\n\nonfusion\n\nA\n\ntaxia\n\nN\n\nystagmus\n\nO\n\nphthamoplegia\n\nPE\n\nripheral\n\nN\n\neuropathy\n\nRetrograde amnesia and confabulation are features of Korsakoff's psychosis\n\nDysarthria and tremor are multifactorial symptom of neurological/systemic disease"
