      "question": "A 74-year-old myopic woman with known hypertension presents with a sudden, painless reduction in her vision. She describes a dense shadow obscuring her right eye, this started peripherally and has progressed towards the central vision.\n\nOn examination, she can only see hand movements in her right eye and has 6/6 visual acuity in her left eye.\n\nWhat is the most likely cause of the loss of vision?",
