      "id": 35,
      "question": "A 68-year-old woman with dry age-related macular degeneration is reviewed by her ophthalmologist with slowly progressive central visual distortion in both eyes. She has a 50-pack-year history of smoking, and continued to smoke 10 per day.\n\nWhat best explains the role of smoking in the pathogenesis of her condition?",
