      "question": "An 88-year-old woman with advanced, metastatic colon cancer is put onto the end-of-life care pathway after long discussions between the patient, family and healthcare team.\n\nThe palliative care team have extensive input and are asked to review the patient after she describes significant oral pain.\n\nWhich of the following would be a useful medication to alleviate this?",
