      "question": "A 28-year-old man with known schizophrenia presents for his annual mental health review. His mental health has stabilised after the initiation of first-line treatment, however, his physical health seems to be deteriorating.\n\nYou realise that his body mass index has increased over the past 5 years from 24kg/m² to 32kg/m² and at the same time, his cholesterol and triglyceride levels have almost doubled.\n\nWhat is the most likely responsible medication in this patient?",
